SUMMARY:NEW MAJOR: International Financial Governance\, Trade\, and Devel
 opment Info Session
DESCRIPTION:Come hear directly from the faculty who are teaching the cour
 ses.  International Financial Governance\, Trade\, and Development is bui
 lt for students who want to work on strategy under real global conditions
 \, the kind that shape tariffs\, trade deals\, and supply chains. In this
  major you'll study global business through real cases\, learn how instit
 utions like the IMF and WTO work\, and run a live trade negotiation simul
 ation.  Join us at the information session to learn more.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>Come hear directly from the facul
 ty who are teaching the courses.</strong></p><p>  International Financial
  Governance\, Trade\, and Development is built for students who want to w
 ork on strategy under real global conditions\, the kind that shape tariff
 s\, trade deals\, and supply chains. In this major you'll study global bu
 siness through real cases\, learn how institutions like the IMF and WTO w
 ork\, and run a live trade negotiation simulation.</p><p>  Join us at the
  information session to learn more.</p>
